{"code":"RD05","wikidata":"Q108596671","wikipedia":{"en":"Chatuchak station","th":"สถานีจตุจักร"},"summary":{"en":"Chatuchak Station is a railway station in Chatuchak District, Bangkok. It serves the SRT Dark Red Line. Chatuchak station was built above the existing Nikhom Rotfai KM.11 ground-level railway halt on the State Railway of Thailand's Northern and Northeastern Main Line which primarily served commuter trains.","th":"สถานีจตุจักร เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าชานเมือง สายธานีรัถยายกระดับเหนือถนนกำแพงเพชร 2 ในพื้นที่แขวงจตุจักร เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพมหานคร เปิดให้บริการเมื่อวันที่ 2 สิงหาคม พ.ศ."},"opened":"2021-08-02","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Chatuchak_Station_%28SRT%29_01.jpg/960px-Chatuchak_Station_%28SRT%29_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chatuchak_Station_(SRT)_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Chatuchak_Station_%28SRT%29_02.jpg/960px-Chatuchak_Station_%28SRT%29_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chatuchak_Station_(SRT)_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Chatuchak_station.jpg/960px-Chatuchak_station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chatuchak_station.jpg","author":"Syced","license":"CC0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/%C4%90%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng_xe_%C4%91i%E1%BB%87n%2C_Chatuchak%2C_chom_phon%2C_bangkok_thailand_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-%C4%90%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng_xe_%C4%91i%E1%BB%87n%2C_Chatuchak%2C_chom_phon%2C_bangkok_thailand_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumb